<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>Watch Agents — your agent hub</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><script type="module" src="newtab.mjs"></script></head>
<body>
<header><a class="brand" href="newtab.html"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">wa</span><span>watch agents<small>YOUR PERSONAL CONTROL HUB</small></span></a><div class="header-actions"><span id="connection-label" class="connection">Not paired</span><button id="refresh" class="quiet" type="button">Refresh</button><button id="open-setup" class="quiet" type="button">Device setup</button></div></header>
<main>
<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ROOM FOR THE BIG PICTURE</p><h1>What are your<br>agents working on?</h1><p class="lead" id="intro-copy">Your Hermes and OpenClaw runs, decisions and next steps. One private view of the hub you own.</p></div><aside class="time-note"><span id="today"></span><p>Check the work.<br>Keep the next move deliberate.</p></aside></section>
<p id="status" class="notice" role="status">Opening this device…</p>
<section id="setup" class="setup panel" hidden aria-labelledby="setup-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONNECT YOUR OWN HUB</p><h2 id="setup-title">Pair this new tab.</h2><p>Create a one-time device code with <code>npm run hubctl -- pair create</code> on your hub. Enter its HTTPS origin and code here.</p><p class="muted">Keys and pairing data stay in this extension’s local device storage. Network access supports your chosen HTTPS hub and localhost development. No account or model provider is added.</p><button id="forget" type="button" class="text-button">Forget this device’s local data</button></div><form id="pair-form"><label for="hub">Hub origin<input id="hub" type="url" placeholder="https://your-hub.example" autocomplete="off" required></label><div class="form-row"><label for="code">Pairing code<input id="code" type="password" minlength="8" maxlength="8" placeholder="8 characters" autocomplete="off" required></label><label for="device-name">Device name<input id="device-name" value="My new tab" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" required></label></div><button id="pair" class="primary" type="submit">Pair device</button></form></section>
<section class="stats" aria-label="Agent status"><div><span class="stat-title">IN PROGRESS</span><strong id="running-count">—</strong><p>Runs doing the work</p></div><div><span class="stat-title">NEEDS YOUR EYES</span><strong id="approval-count">—</strong><p>Pending decisions</p></div><div><span class="stat-title">READY TO CONTINUE</span><strong id="followup-count">—</strong><p>Stored follow-up drafts</p></div><div><span class="stat-title">LAST 7 DAYS</span><strong id="week-count">—</strong><p id="week-caption">Recorded run starts</p></div></section>
<section class="workspace"><div class="runs-column"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE</p><h2>Runs &amp; next steps</h2></div><span id="freshness" class="muted">Refresh to read your hub</span></div><div class="filter-bar"><label class="search-label" for="search">Find a run<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search titles, agents or summaries" maxlength="240"></label><label for="filter">Show<select id="filter"><option value="all">All runs</option><option value="active">In progress</option><option value="attention">Needs attention</option><option value="finished">Finished</option></select></label></div><div id="runs" aria-live="polite"></div></div><aside class="activity-column"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THIS DEVICE</p><h2>Saved requests</h2></div></div><p class="muted">A hub acknowledgement stays with its original request. If a response is lost, retry that exact request here.</p><div id="intents"></div><button id="clear-acknowledged" type="button" class="text-button">Clear acknowledged local receipts</button></aside></section>
<dialog id="review"><form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close quiet" value="cancel" aria-label="Close review">Close</button></form><p class="eyebrow">REVIEW BEFORE SENDING</p><h2 id="review-title"></h2><p id="review-origin" class="muted"></p><pre id="review-text"></pre><p id="review-note" class="muted"></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button id="review-cancel" type="button" class="quiet">Keep reviewing</button><button id="review-send" type="button" class="primary">Send reviewed request</button></div></dialog>
</main><footer><span>watch agents / new tab</span><p>Self-hosted. Single owner. Every agent action starts with your decision.</p><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/smart-watch-agents" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source &amp; setup ↗</a></footer>
</body></html>
